{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_absin_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_absin_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"向死寻生","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_absin_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"52040b3565eace8b1c88f0861e8ae87ad2facda86631a2ba843af8fcae2a416b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在救援任务中受困于天灾塌方，不得不与早露合作寻找脱险方法的苦艾，意外直面了同伴坚强表象之下的真实。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"地下废墟"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这里是罗德岛干员......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......重复，这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员......早露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"约两个小时三十分钟前，我们于乌萨斯边境天灾疏散任务中与队伍失散，陷入一处塌方形成的地下空洞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......目前暂时没有人员伤亡。最后的位置坐标......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到请回复。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，还是联络不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我得再换个位置——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——你怎么站起来了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该坐下来好好休息，你的腿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你离开了三十分钟，有什么发现吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......很遗憾，没有能帮助我们离开这里的发现呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你说的没错，里面的确是一个自然形成的溶洞，但透光处位于更深处的正上方，而不是直线尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"无法沿着洞穴离开，头顶的透光处又过高，没有外部援助，我们很难出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来和这里的情况差不多。我知道了，谢谢你的确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不用谢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不如说，反而是我应该谢谢你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，苦艾小姐，你感觉好些了吗？你的伤口怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我在后勤部门的时候，学习过有限条件下的急救措施，可以再帮你检查一下止血情况，然后换药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不要急着拒绝我。你为了救我受伤，又带着我避开了后续的余震。这都是我应该做的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......东侧已经疏散完毕，确认没有居民了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山脚的最后一户也已经安全转移。时间不够了，我们需要尽快撤离，否则天灾——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——当心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"苦艾小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抓住我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"腿部传来的剧痛使苦艾的声音变得扭曲。但她很快将痛呼压低，隐忍不发，强行将注意力转移到周围。\n在这陡至的黑暗中，她一无所获。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......看不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"之后肯定还有余震，得快点转移位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——光棒不在我这里。早......娜塔莉娅！你能听见我说话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉娅？"},{"type":"narration","text":"她伸出手去，交握的掌心仍然温热，所幸两人并未因坠落而彻底分散开来。\n但此刻另一只手的主人却毫无回音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......昏迷了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有血腥味，黏稠......她头上好像也出血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"头部出血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"得先转移位置，最好有些光线才能看清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（轻敲断壁）"},{"type":"narration","text":"断壁横梁带出一阵空洞的回响，驱散头脑中的混沌。闭眼后再睁眼，她的视野逐渐清晰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......来吧，来吧。至少给我一个更安全的方向。"},{"type":"narration","text":"苦艾搀扶起昏迷的同伴，向隐约有光的地方挪去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是做了我应该做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换了罗德岛的其他任何人，他们也都会这样做。带着同伴，找到结构更稳定的地下空间，争取救援时间......固定流程而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且就像你头上的伤一样，我的腿伤也不严重，都是外伤，已经止血，也没有骨头需要掰正，急救派不上用场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用太在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那......通讯器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是无法联络外界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且因为里面储存的能源剩得不多，我们不能一直保持开机状态，等待信号被捕捉，只能间隔一段时间再尝试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那我现在还能做些什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前暂时只能先等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想问什么，可以直接问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"有这么明显吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我是想问我们最后疏散的、住在山脚下的那对母子，他们是不是真的安全撤离了？因为地震来得很突然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，如果真的联络不上外界，到时候我们该怎么办呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，在和你会合之前，我确认过那对母子已经疏散到安全地带。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二，如果主动联络失败，等他们清点人数时发现我们缺席，也会派人出来寻找的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都在常规流程中，就像我之前救你一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你总是这么可靠吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你很可靠，好像没有什么困境能击溃你。现在如果只有我一个人在这里，我肯定不知道该怎么办了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在切尔诺伯格——在那种地方，当事故发生，如果你真的不知道应该做什么，又怎么能从那儿活着离开呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更不要说现在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我总是忘记你也是从切城......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀。为了活下去，我做过一些事，但也得到了许多帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我更不明白之前你为什么要选择折返。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明可以安全离开，却选择回来和我们一起继续疏散不愿离开的村民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有救援任务经验的干员就该在天灾来临前随大部队一起返回，而不是留下来。万一我之前没能救下你，或者这次我们真的没能出去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你之前那些为了活下来而做的努力就全都白费了，帮助过你的人，他们的努力也都白费了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"道理是这样，没错。可如果每次我都不选择留下，那我永远都会是那个没有经验的新人，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"永远原地踏步，永远帮助不了更多的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想像你们一样，能做更多......这也是为什么我选择从后勤转到前线来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这些理由不能改变你在没有足够能力的前提下，主动选择了“危险”这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你其实并不把自己的性命当成什么重要的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）真不知道，那些帮过你，甚至为此丢了性命的人......会怎么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"可你有话没有说完。为什么不说完呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，这本来也不关我的事，是我多话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经间隔一段时间了，我换个位置，调整一下通讯器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露，重复，这里是罗德岛干员......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"也许再举高一些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正在尝试——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断续的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——探测仪——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断续的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——嗞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露！我们于乌萨斯边境天灾疏散任务中与队伍失散，陷入一处塌方形成的地下空洞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们最后的位置坐标——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断续的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——嗞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？请问能听到吗？我们最后的坐标是61.700.20.450——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，好不容易......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但既然能收到通讯，就说明这附近有其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"让我拿着通讯器去洞穴里试试吧，说不定在透光处下面，通讯状况会更好呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洞穴......那我们一起过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你的伤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过了，没有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这种情况下，我们本来就更应该一起行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那我来搀着你吧，总能节省一些力气......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"苦艾轻轻摇头，避过了那只向她伸来的手。\n眼前人的力气足够拎起巨大的攻城器械，自然也足够搀扶一位体重偏轻的伤者。\n在她的帮助下前进应该是此刻最合适的选择，可不知为何，苦艾就是不愿这样做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们就，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......在这边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"先前我沿着边缘寻找，想看看有没有通道的时候，发现了这个地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧，一个不大不小的石墩，站上去虽然能离头顶的光源更近一点，但对触摸到透光处来说还差得远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"总之请稍等，等我爬上去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你小心——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"——好了！请把通讯器递给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......坐标记住了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"记住了，很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......咦？这个要在哪里打开呢？好像和之前我用过的通讯器有点不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，这是我自己改装的通讯器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"频段我已经调好了，你按下侧面的长方形按钮开机。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隐约的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——嗞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"有声音！这算不算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信号被接收了，和刚才一样，按照我教给你的汇报就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露，我们于乌萨斯边境天灾疏散任务中与队伍失散，陷入一处塌方形成的地下空洞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"最后位置坐标为61.700.20.450。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"重复，最后位置坐标为——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——喂？——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能听到吗？这里是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——天灾信使——喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回复说能听到，然后重复坐标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我们能听到！这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露，我们需要支援，最后位置坐标为61.700.20.450！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——收到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请在原地——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——等——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我——抱歉，我没听清他最后说了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要成功传回了坐标，就成功了一半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我们就先回原来的地方吧。那里结构相对稳定，之前两次余震都没有受到多少影响，更安全，也更适合等待救援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯又中断了，天灾应该还没有完全过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在最重要的，是在救援人员到达之前，保证自己的安全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按时间来说应该就快到了，我在最开始停留的地方做了记号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看见一块红色的布料了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有看见。不过我这里还有两根光棒，用它们来照明吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我一根。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，还是先留着吧。我们不知道救援人员具体的到达时间，不要把物资提前用光了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我记得应该就在这附近......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——是余震！该死——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"苦艾小姐，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别过来！蹲下，然后用手抱住头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照我说的做！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坍塌不严重，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光源被挡住了，钢管和横梁应该没有继续断裂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉娅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉娅，你怎么样了？能听见我说话吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"回答她的只有灰尘簌簌落下的动静，和逐渐沉重的呼吸声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿、嘿，我听见了。来，把手给我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你拿着光棒，正好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"影影绰绰的光照中，苦艾看到另一个女孩维持着抱头的姿势，蜷缩在不远处。\n碎石和尘灰落在她的背上、身侧，外伤的痕迹并不显著。\n那声痛呼并不是从她嘴里发出的。\n......对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......呜......啊......！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪，你抖得厉害，你伤到哪里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能帮你——呃——救援人员就快到了，你再坚持一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"——杀了我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"直接杀了我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因为——是因为太痛了吗？你为什么会这样说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我请求您......帮帮我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得知道你伤到哪里才能帮忙，但你一直在躲开我，这样我没有办法——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"原本蜷缩在地上的女孩被抓住，终于放下了抱着头的双手。她抬起脸，向黑暗之中的某处虚空定定望去。\n她这是怎么了？无数的问题充斥着苦艾的大脑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呜、呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不......不——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我请求您，我请求您......不要把我留在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会把你留在这里，我不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，告诉我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你什么也不告诉我，那我要怎么帮你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不清。我看不见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我什么也看不见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你看不见？难道你的眼睛受伤了？还是头部受伤，淤血压迫了神经？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你保持不动，我得看看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩只是失神地呢喃，眼睛中没有任何人的倒影。如果苦艾更早地举起光棒仔细去看，就能轻易发现这点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼睛看上去没有聚焦，头上似乎没有新的伤口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有哪里受伤了吗？是什么让你痛成这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢一点，尽量清晰地告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行？为什么不行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧，我都在说些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"您还是杀了我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......杀了我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟为什么一直要说这种话？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"苦艾猛地后退了两步。烟尘在空中剧烈地颤抖，一如她本人的心绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们先前——我们先前在这里说过的那些，都是不存在的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说你想活下来，想帮助更多的人，那也都只是冠冕堂皇的假话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"——是啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！什——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您杀了我吧！就像您放了那把火一样杀了我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"与其让我这样苟活，倒不如令我痛快地死去，就像我害死的那些人，他们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不会要我活着。您也不需要我活着，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"只需要用您的那柄斧子，对着这里来上一下......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"苦艾看见女孩用手在自己脖颈的位置用力地划过。她没来得及阻止，光棒的亮度也不足以使她看清是否有划伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"就像这样，很快的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一切都让苦艾感到难以理解。她仿佛听见有什么东西一点点碎裂的声音，即使这在当下几乎是不可能真正发生的。\n这里没有其他人了，那么这碎裂就只能存在于她们两人之间。\n沉默间，苦艾走上前去，将早露侧向一旁的上身强行掰正。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我只有这一个请求......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"这也不可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你究竟是怎么了，但我听见了你说的话。而我不能对这些话坐视不理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你的命不是你一个人的，就像我的也不是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"其实理智要她吞下那些话。可下一秒，她就果断将理智抛却了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的命属于那些被永远留下的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......求你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死在切城的人太多了。你有没有读过事后的报告？我读过，就算我怎么也数不清遇难者名单上那些小小的名字，也还是一遍遍地去数......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想找到瓦列里叔叔的名字，找到......找到我父亲的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他去过彼得海姆，然后把命丢在了那儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道那里当时究竟发生过什么，我只能猜测，然后不断地观察你们这些从彼得海姆来的幸存者，试图得到一个答案，关于......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......谁在说......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于我父亲的牺牲究竟换来了什么，在你们身上，究竟有什么值得他牺牲的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，我必须知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我没有答案！我一直都没有找到——所以我本来都打算不去想了，直到你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到你突然从后勤转到前线，出现在这样的任务里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为你向前走了。你有吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你并没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说了！我不会杀你！既然做出了选择，那你凭什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你凭什么不好好珍惜自己的生命？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......求你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你实在想死，可以。等我们从这里出去，等到没人注意的时候，你有无数种方法——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了我吧，索尼娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——随便你......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"就只是，杀了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不要、不要让我活着留在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，什么也没有啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“索尼娅”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是我的名字，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认为自己现在在哪儿？在切城吗？在彼得海姆吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"苦艾终于理解了一切。她沉默着，折断了最后一根光棒，也问出了最后一个不会有回答的问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你......并没有从创伤中恢复，又为什么要申请成为前线干员，为什么要以身涉险？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你难道预料不到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这样狼狈的时刻吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"苦艾紧紧抓住早露的小臂。她用力、更用力地攥紧，使掌心的滚烫紧贴着滚烫。\n借着这阵令人疼痛的接触，失魂的人终于猛地震颤了一下。\n她眨了眨眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"学校的食堂......是这样的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不、我记不清——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经不在切城了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那我在哪儿？你又是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在正在地下某处，我是罗德岛干员苦艾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"地下。为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......因为你想救更多的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而现在，我们要找到走出去的方法。如果你能听见我说话，就闭上眼睛，跟着我，深呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我带你走出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"苦艾深深地吸气，而后呼出，如此反复。\n失神的女孩起初并不明白这动作的意义，然而在苦艾锲而不舍地重复之后——\n她终于缓慢地动起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"方寸之间，唯有呼吸声震耳欲聋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么样了？你感觉还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呃、苦艾小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我这是......怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......我怎么哭了？真不好意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，只是耽误了一些时间。我们得再试试联络外界了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露，最后位置坐标为61.700.20.450。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重复，这里是罗德岛干员苦艾与干员早露——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦？好像有频段接入了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂——喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里是罗德岛灾后搜救小队，请直接报上坐标——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......接上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后位置坐标为61.700.20.450，建议搜寻西侧塌陷地块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这里有两个人，状态......尚可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜......早露，请按照之前我说的节奏敲响你身边的钢管。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"两轻一重......是这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"坐标是之前收到过的那个，求救信号......红外探测仪显示——好、好近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——喂？还能听到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果能听见，就用刚才的频率敲击钢管，回应我们——"},{"type":"narration","text":"搜救队伍到了。\n苦艾向着声音传来的上方抬起头，早露则再次敲响身边最近的钢管。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人！下面有人！就在我们收到的坐标附近，应该就是她们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"稍等，我们马上开展救援，请待在原地，不要随意移动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到请敲一下钢管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（敲一下钢管）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请稍等——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上有伤，一会儿你先上去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我的身体状况更好一些，没问题的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g15_eveningglow_L2"},{"type":"narration","text":"尽管早就知道劫后余生的喜悦并不如书本中描述的那样强烈，苦艾还是感到一阵恍然。\n在云朵仿若火焰一样铺开的天空之下，她深深地、像呼吸一样感受着这阵转瞬即逝的情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......干员苦艾状态确认，初步判断为轻伤，已成功获救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请先在一旁休息，不要剧烈运动，等干员早露也被营救上来之后，我会马上帮你重新处理小腿伤口——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——干员苦艾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我来帮忙吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么？你还是别动——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......咦？苦艾小姐，你的伤——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没什么要紧的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把手给我吧，我会拉你上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"干员早露。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_197_poca","aliases":["早露"]}]}
